ODdfWVVlUjJ6MHUxY2Q0REItRnlubFNLb0Rhdks5TUFjUUh2ZEZ3VkEtemNVSGVOOWtRTGFkYlBGaHBvd0hEdUFSdU1nQkF0aVdzMWxNb1J1T2tR?oc=5","date":"2026-10-19","zh":"分析師推薦：康菲石油公司、Datadog、英特爾、Fair Isaac、米高梅度假村…"},{"title":"Fair Isaac (FICO) Stock Forecast and Price Target 2026 $FICO","src":"MarketBeat","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTE54c0NBcDZBaDBXS2RTRG1uTDVheS14V1AydjE0bUlmSEM4RjFCTnB6c0lQcmtmaXUzMHhwRGNWcDNNdl9jQ0l1Zlp2d3FTbzlyMl9pNlpEcXFYWmlpU2hTMjNDVQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-19","zh":"Fair Isaac (FICO) 股票預測與 2026 年價格目標 $FICO"},{"title":"What Investors Overlooked Before Fair Isaac Fell 53%","src":"Simply Wall Street","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-18","zh":"Fair Isaac 股價下跌 53% 之前投資者忽略了什麼"},{"title":"RBC Capital Maintains Fair Isaac(FICO.US) With Buy Rating, Cuts Target Price to $1,045","src":"Moomoo","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxQekNOYlJMTXZDNzdhOV9MaEtRWEJhTWFLaVJYM1BGUlNEc0IzSWpybld4SjgzaVktUDBaQzlON09Ba3N3MjFTSi1BZjkxbi1PdS1QU1JyMEZiWDhIemM5VEE3M3NCQlF4cEo0YTkyYk5DOHNCNTZ4MjBQcXJjWktwdFFXekZINzQyUDR5Wkl4Q1paS0RzOXlkR3U4ZEpTTXhhekNaTnpwaw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-16","zh":"RBC Capital 維持 Fair Isaac(FICO.US) 買入評級，並將目標價下調至 1,045 美元"}],"themes":[{"name":"分析師評等","count":4},{"name":"財報","count":2}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2025-11-07","period":"2025-09-30","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/814547/000081454725000030/fico-20250930.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Fair Isaac Corporation (NYSE: FICO) (together with its consolidated subsidiaries, the \"Company,\" which may also be referred to in this report as \"we,\" \"us,\" \"our,\" and \"FICO\") is a global analytics software leader. We were founded in 1956 on the premise that data, used intelligently, can improve business decisions. Today, FICO's software and the widely used FICO Score operationalize analytics, enabling thousands of businesses in more than 80 countries to uncover new opportunities, make timely decisions that matter, and execute them at scale. Most leading banks and credit card issuers rely on our solutions, as do insurers, retailers, telecommunications providers, automotive lenders, consumer reporting agencies, public agencies, and organizations in other industries. We also serve consumers through online services that enable people to access and understand their FICO Scores — the standard","zh":"Fair Isaac Corporation（NYSE：FICO）（連同其合併子公司統稱為“公司”，在本報告中也可能稱為“我們”、“我們的”和“FICO”）是全球分析軟體領導者。我們成立於 1956 年，我們的理念是：智慧地使用資料可以改善商業決策。如今，FICO 的軟體和廣泛使用的 FICO Score 可實施分析，使 80 多個國家/地區的數千家企業能夠發現新機會、及時做出重要決策並大規模執行。大多數領先的銀行和信用卡發行機構都依賴我們的解決方案，保險公司、零售商、電信供應商、汽車貸款機構、消費者報告機構、公共機構和其他行業的組織也是如此。我們還透過線上服務為消費者提供服務，使人們能夠存取和了解他們的 FICO 分數——標準"},{"en":"Our Scores segment includes our business-to-business (\"B2B\") scoring solutions and services which give our clients access to predictive credit and other scores that can be easily integrated into their transaction streams and decision-making processes. This segment also includes our business-to-consumer (\"B2C\") scoring solutions, including our myFICO.com subscription offerings.","zh":"我們的分數部門包括我們的企業對企業（「B2B」）評分解決方案和服務，使我們的客戶能夠獲得預測信用和其他分數，這些分數可以輕鬆整合到他們的交易流程和決策流程中。該部分還包括我們的企業對消費者（「B2C」）評分解決方案，包括我們的 myFICO.com 訂閱產品。"},{"en":"Our Software segment includes pre-configured analytic and decision management solutions designed for a specific type of business need or process — such as account origination, customer management, customer engagement, fraud detection, and marketing — as well as associated professional services. This segment also includes FICO Platform, a modular software offering designed to support advanced analytic and decision use cases, as well as stand-alone analytic and decisioning software that can be configured by our customers to address a wide variety of business use cases. Our offerings are available to our customers as software-as-a-service (\"SaaS\") or as on-premises software.","zh":"我們的軟體部門包括專為特定類型的業務需求或流程（例如帳戶發起、客戶管理、客戶參與、詐欺偵測和行銷）而設計的預先配置分析和決策管理解決方案以及相關的專業服務。此細分市場還包括 FICO 平台，這是一種模組化軟體產品，旨在支援進階分析和決策案例，以及可由客戶配置以解決各種業務用例的獨立分析和決策軟體。我們的產品以軟體即服務（「SaaS」）或本地軟體的形式提供給客戶。"}],"markets":[{"en":"Our Scores segment includes our business-to-business (\"B2B\") scoring solutions and services which give our clients access to predictive credit and other scores that can be easily integrated into their transaction streams and decision-making processes. This segment also includes our business-to-consumer (\"B2C\") scoring solutions, including our myFICO.com subscription offerings.","zh":"我們的分數部門包括我們的企業對企業（「B2B」）評分解決方案和服務，使我們的客戶能夠獲得預測信用和其他分數，這些分數可以輕鬆整合到他們的交易流程和決策流程中。該部分還包括我們的企業對消費者（「B2C」）評分解決方案，包括我們的 myFICO.com 訂閱產品。"},{"en":"Our Software segment includes pre-configured analytic and decision management solutions designed for a specific type of business need or process — such as account origination, customer management, customer engagement, fraud detection, and marketing — as well as associated professional services. This segment also includes FICO Platform, a modular software offering designed to support advanced analytic and decision use cases, as well as stand-alone analytic and decisioning software that can be configured by our customers to address a wide variety of business use cases. Our offerings are available to our customers as software-as-a-service (\"SaaS\") or as on-premises software.","zh":"我們的軟體部門包括專為特定類型的業務需求或流程（例如帳戶發起、客戶管理、客戶參與、詐欺偵測和行銷）而設計的預先配置分析和決策管理解決方案以及相關的專業服務。此細分市場還包括 FICO 平台，這是一種模組化軟體產品，旨在支援進階分析和決策案例，以及可由客戶配置以解決各種業務用例的獨立分析和決策軟體。我們的產品以軟體即服務（「SaaS」）或本地軟體的形式提供給客戶。"}],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The market for our solutions is intensely competitive and is constantly changing. Our competitors vary both in size and in the scope of the products and services they offer. We encounter competition from several sources, including:","zh":"我們的解決方案市場競爭激烈且不斷變化。我們的競爭對手的規模以及所提供的產品和服務的範圍各不相同。我們遇到來自多個來源的競爭，包括："},{"en":"We believe we offer customers a unique mix of products, expertise and capabilities that allows us to compete effectively in our target markets. However, many of our competitors are larger than FICO, have more development, sales and marketing resources than FICO, and some have larger shares of our target geographic or product markets.","zh":"我們相信，我們為客戶提供獨特的產品、專業知識和能力組合，使我們能夠在目標市場中有效競爭。然而，我們的許多競爭對手比 FICO 規模更大，擁有比 FICO 更多的開發、銷售和行銷資源，有些競爭對手在我們的目標地理或產品市場上擁有更大的份額。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-09-30","items":[{"name":"Scores","val":1168575000,"zh":"分數"},{"name":"Software","val":822294000,"zh":"軟體"}],"total":1990869000},"prod":{"end":"2025-09-30","items":[{"name":"Scores Products","val":1168575000,"zh":"分數產品"},{"name":"On Premises & Saa S Software","val":740145000,"zh":"本地和 SaaS 軟體"},{"name":"Technology Service","val":82149000,"zh":"技術服務"}],"total":1990869000},"geo":{"end":"2025-09-30","items":[{"name":"Americas","val":1732385000,"zh":"美洲"},{"name":"EMEA","val":159803000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":98681000,"zh":"亞太"}],"total":1990869000}},"peers":["SPGI","MSCI","TYL","MCO","TDG"]}}